WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
Alejandro Alcazar
expressed his gratitude

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.600
for receiving this award, which recognizes
a whole year of effort.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.500
He especially thanked
the Sunland Park community

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.000
and stressed that working as a team,
like a family,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.300
is the foundation for offering
warm, personal service

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.500
to people looking for guidance
on health plans.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.400
And here I am with Alejandro Alcazar,
who is here on behalf of his family,

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.100
together with his family.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.500
So you won these awards?
How do you feel, Alejandro?

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.000
Really good.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:33.200
All the work of the year
finally paid off,

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.300
and I'm very grateful to serve
the Sunland Park community.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.000
My brother Humberto, my mom Silvia,

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.300
many people already know her
in the El Paso community,

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:46.200
and soon we'll be
on the east side of El Paso

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.000
to serve the very large
community there.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:50.600
Hey, you're going to put those trophies
in the office, right?

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.900
Yes, of course, so people can see them
and come take a look.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:56.100
We invite you to come see them,

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.900
because we were the… [unclear audio]
